	(text "|IA| > 410 A (band 382-441 A, own REF3030E + 0.1 % network, CM-cancelling) AND FB = closed AND\nDIAG = valid -> HOLD2. Test injection 86.6 k from A_TST_T2A (side A) / A_TST_T2B (side B): shifts the threshold\nby 459 A, so a healthy side trips at 0 A under TEST only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 283.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "12f56632-ad0f-5c0a-89ab-adddb6d3e9f9")
	)
	(text "HOLD-CLOSED LOGIC, CHANNEL 2 (IRFL214 LOW SIDE)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 206.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2d728c59-367a-5e4d-9b71-8fc64029f96b")
	)
	(text "RB1 = OC1 OR hold high-side output present (100 k / 15 k): at rest RB1 = 1 means a stuck channel 1.\nRB2 = OC2. PV-PORT sums them onto the ID line (board_io); firmware reads RB1 + RB2 against the\nmeasured current in operation and through the proof-test windows at start."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 352.324 362.644 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4dca0253-b826-552c-8d87-5c64a3f6d0b1")
	)
	(text "6 x TNPV1206 1.00 M (167 V each at 1000 V) + 4.99 k: 1 V = 1203 V, clip 1504 V. 4.7 nF: lag\n<= 27 us incl. AMC3330. Out: VAX_P/N (+/-2 V on 1.44 V, PORT contract). HGND = BUS-."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 164.968 104.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
