	(text "Linear +/-500 A, clip +/-640 A (OC trip 270 A, SC trip 450 A inside). 10 ohm + 10 nF input\nfilter (SBASA11B Fig 8-2). HGND on the shunt's X- bolt by its own trace. Fail-safe out = -2.57 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 318.868 99.184 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "89995509-31ac-53a0-a37d-7d01bd8014cd")
	)
	(text "100 k / 15 k -> Schmitt buffer T (ch1 side A). T -> 47 k / 22 uF -> T_d (ch1 side B). One-shots\n(3.3 uF / 47 k) of T -> T2A (ch2 side A) and of T_d -> T2B (ch2 side B). No single fault trips both\nchannels for longer than one one-shot. Firmware runs it at every start, contactor open and closed\n(report sec. 7.4: windows, what it finds and what it does not)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 370.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a4380420-842e-5565-94c5-84379179349c")
	)
	(text "VAX - TERMINAL-SIDE VOLTAGE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 164.968 19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "aec4ae8d-4e18-5d67-830a-5c4c0009b5b3")
	)
	(text "|IA| > 410 A (band 382-441 A, own REF3030E + 0.1 % network, CM-cancelling) AND FB = closed AND\nDIAG = valid -> HOLD1. Test injection 86.6 k from A_TST_T (side A) / A_TST_TD (side B): shifts the threshold\nby 459 A, so a healthy side trips at 0 A under TEST only."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 194.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b8ed2beb-ae57-5e26-8699-0d282c1daed8")
	)
	(text "6 x TNPV1206 1.00 M (167 V each at 1000 V) + 4.99 k: 1 V = 1203 V, clip 1504 V. 4.7 nF: lag\n<= 27 us incl. AMC3330. Out: VA_P/N (+/-2 V on 1.44 V, PORT contract). HGND = BUS-."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 104.94 0)
		(effects
